{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06557","headline":"同王十三维偶然作十首 四 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维偶然作十首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮云在虚空，随风复卷舒。\n我心方处顺，动作何忧虞。\n但言婴世网，不复得间居。\n迢递别东国，超遥来西都。\n见人乃恭敬，曾不问贤愚。\n虽若不能言，中心亦难诬。\n故乡满亲戚，道远情日疎。\n偶欲陈此意，复无南飞凫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}